<title>USA: Watson gets FDA ok for capsule.</title>
<headline>Watson gets FDA ok for capsule.</headline>
<dateline>CORONA, Calif 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Watson Pharmaceuticals Inc said its wholly-owned unit, Watson Laboratories Inc, has received approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) for an off-patent capsule form of Mexitil, used in the treatment of both abnormal rhythm and heart rate.</p>
<p>Sales of Mexitil, which is marketed by Boehringer Ingelheim, are estimated to be approximately $20 million for 1996.</p>
</text>
